  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>To make <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> as Reflexive, the required elements are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>To make <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> as Symmetric, the required elements are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>To make <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> as Transitive, the required elements are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> elements are required to make <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> an equivalence relation.</p><p>Hence, the total number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>.</p>",
